      "body": "## Background\nThe scheduler always passes `pp_proxy_tensors=` to all speculative workers' `forward_batch_generation()`, but UNO and Frozen KV MTP workers were missing this parameter in their method signature, causing a `TypeError` at runtime.\n\nThis is the second wave of the spec-v2 worker signature drift tracked in **#40155**: eagle / multi_layer_eagle / dflash / dspark / ngram were already patched earlier in the series; the two remaining ones are `uno_worker_v2.py` and `frozen_kv_mtp_worker_v2.py`.\n\n## Problem\nWhen running with `tp_size > 1` and the non-overlapped speculative decoding path, the scheduler raised:\n\n```\nTypeError: forward_batch_generation() got an unexpected keyword argument \"pp_proxy_tensors\"\n```\n\n## Solution\nAdded `pp_proxy_tensors=None` to `forward_batch_generation()` in both files:\n\n- `python/sglang/srt/speculative/uno_worker_v2.py`\n- `python/sglang/srt/speculative/frozen_kv_mtp_worker_v2.py`\n\nUNO and Frozen KV MTP do not run pipeline-parallel stages, so they simply `del pp_proxy_tensors` to satisfy the shared signature contract — exactly the pattern the rest of the spec-v2 worker family uses for kwargs they ignore.\n\nThis brings all **7** spec-v2 workers (eagle, multi_layer_eagle, dflash, dspark, ngram, uno, frozen_kv_mtp) back to a consistent signature that accepts `pp_proxy_tensors=` unconditionally.\n\n## Testing\n- `python -c \"import ast; ast.parse(open(f).read())\"` on both edited files — syntax OK.\n- Grep + regex verification that every `forward_batch_generation()` in `python/sglang/srt/speculative/**` now accepts `pp_proxy_tensors`.\n\nFixes #40155.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38557303304](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557303304)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38557303327](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557303327)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38557303254](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38557303254)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
