  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Noticed all FAIL checks are **infrastructure / pre-run gate** (`pr-gate`, `call-gate`, `Check PR title`, `check-changes`, `pr-test-*-finish`) — no lint or actual test failures on your changes. The `pr-gate` jobs fire when the PR is missing the `run-ci` label (repo-level triage workflow), `Check PR title` enforces the `[Area]: description` convention, and the `pr-test-*-finish` jobs are downstream aggregators that fail whenever upstream gates fail. Close+reopen to kick a fresh run — if you'd like full CI, a maintainer will need to add `run-ci`.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-14T11:31:41Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/44246#issuecomment-6167348181",
